      "index": "b26",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1967733987,
      "version": 426,
      "versionNonce": 492375779,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774888180193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Conclusión: Linked List\nI could do it with an Array that give me O(1) in a dequeue and 8 bytes per element\nin memory but at the cost of O(n) in an enqueue, so I selected Linked List because\nmemory (32 bytes per node) is an acceptable trade-off here if we win constant time ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Conclusión: Linked List\nI could do it with an Array that give me O(1) in a dequeue and 8 bytes per element\nin memory but at the cost of O(n) in an enqueue, so I selected Linked List because\nmemory (32 bytes per node) is an acceptable trade-off here if we win constant time ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
